{"n":96,"name":"Al-Alaq","meaning":"The Clot","ayahs":19,"startPage":597,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"ٱقۡرَأۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ","tr":"Iqra biismi rabbika allathee khalaqa","en":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created"},{"i":2,"ar":"خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِنۡ عَلَقٍ","tr":"Khalaqa alinsana min AAalaqin","en":"Created man from a clinging substance"},{"i":3,"ar":"ٱقۡرَأۡ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلۡأَكۡرَمُ","tr":"Iqra warabbuka alakramu","en":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous"},{"i":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِي عَلَّمَ بِٱلۡقَلَمِ","tr":"Allathee AAallama bialqalami","en":"Who taught by the pen"},{"i":5,"ar":"عَلَّمَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مَا لَمۡ يَعۡلَمۡ","tr":"AAallama alinsana ma lam yaAAlam","en":"Taught man that which he knew not"},{"i":6,"ar":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لَيَطۡغَىٰٓ","tr":"Kalla inna alinsana layatgha","en":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses"},{"i":7,"ar":"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰٓ","tr":"An raahu istaghna","en":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient"},{"i":8,"ar":"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجۡعَىٰٓ","tr":"Inna ila rabbika alrrujAAa","en":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return"},{"i":9,"ar":"أَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي يَنۡهَىٰ","tr":"Araayta allathee yanha","en":"Have you seen the one who forbids"},{"i":10,"ar":"عَبۡدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","tr":"AAabdan itha salla","en":"A servant when he prays"},{"i":11,"ar":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلۡهُدَىٰٓ","tr":"Araayta in kana AAala alhuda","en":"Have you seen if he is upon guidance"},{"i":12,"ar":"أَوۡ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقۡوَىٰٓ","tr":"Aw amara bialttaqwa","en":"Or enjoins righteousness"},{"i":13,"ar":"أَرَءَيۡتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","tr":"Araayta in kaththaba watawalla","en":"Have you seen if he denies and turns away"},{"i":14,"ar":"أَلَمۡ يَعۡلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","tr":"Alam yaAAlam bianna Allaha yara","en":"Does he not know that Allah sees"},{"i":15,"ar":"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمۡ يَنتَهِ لَنَسۡفَعَۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","tr":"Kalla lain lam yantahi lanasfaAAan bialnnasiyati","en":"No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock"},{"i":16,"ar":"نَاصِيَةٖ كَٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٖ","tr":"Nasiyatin kathibatin khatiatin","en":"A lying, sinning forelock"},{"i":17,"ar":"فَلۡيَدۡعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","tr":"FalyadAAu nadiyahu","en":"Then let him call his associates"},{"i":18,"ar":"سَنَدۡعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","tr":"SanadAAu alzzabaniyata","en":"We will call the angels of Hell"},{"i":19,"ar":"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعۡهُ وَٱسۡجُدۡۤ وَٱقۡتَرِب۩","tr":"Kalla la tutiAAhu waosjud waiqtarib","en":"No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allah]"}]}